      "n": 12,
      "kind": "content",
      "title": "",
      "text": "12\nThe Law of Diminishing Marginal Utility\nThe utility gained from successive units of a commodity diminishes. In other words, the marginal utility of a commodity diminishes as consumer acquires larger quantities of it.",
      "bullets": [
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "12"
        },
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "The Law of Diminishing Marginal Utility"
        },
        {
          "level": 0,
          "text": "The utility gained from successive units of a commodity diminishes. In other words, the marginal utility of a commodity diminishes as consumer acquires larger quantities of it."
